DTX-2PC 内核补丁 0004：pre_record_commit_hook

依据 pg-partdist-src/docs/DTX_2PC_DESIGN.md §9.3。

分布式事务的决议（dtx_decide）必须严格发生在"Citus 已把 PREPARE TRANSACTION
发给全部参与者之后、本地 commit record 落盘之前"这个窗口里。

XactCallback 走不通：回调是 LIFO 顺序，pg_partdist 在 Citus 之后加载，它注册的
XACT_EVENT_PRE_COMMIT 回调必然跑在 **Citus 的回调之前** —— 那时 Citus 还没发
PREPARE，无从判断参与者是否都已 prepared。而调换加载顺序这条路是堵死的：
Citus 强制要求自己排 shared_preload_libraries 第一位。

因此在 CommitTransaction() 里、CallXactCallbacks(XACT_EVENT_PRE_COMMIT) **之后**、
RecordTransactionCommit() **之前**开一个 hook。

这个位置的关键性质：
  1. 全部 XactCallback（含 Citus 的远程 PREPARE）都已执行完毕；
  2. 本地 commit record 尚未写入，hook 里 ereport(ERROR) 还能干净地把整个事务
     翻进 abort 路径 —— 参与者的 prepared 事务随后被推定中止；
  3. 事务状态仍是 TRANS_INPROGRESS，SPI / libpq 都能正常使用。
放在 XACT_EVENT_COMMIT（post-commit）则本地已经提交，决议失败时无法回头，
**绝对不能放那里**。

并行 worker 不触发（is_parallel_worker）：它提交的不是自己的分布式事务。

--- a/src/include/access/xact.h
+++ b/src/include/access/xact.h
@@ -137,6 +137,24 @@
 
 typedef void (*XactCallback) (XactEvent event, void *arg);
 
+/*
+ * pre_record_commit_hook -- fired inside CommitTransaction(), after every
+ * XACT_EVENT_PRE_COMMIT callback has run and before RecordTransactionCommit().
+ *
+ * Why this cannot be an XactCallback: callbacks run in LIFO order, so a module
+ * loaded later runs *earlier*, and no callback can express "after every other
+ * module's PRE_COMMIT work is done".  Distributed-transaction commit decisions
+ * need exactly that position (see pg_partdist's DTX-2PC design).
+ *
+ * Contract:
+ *   - the local commit record has not been written yet, so ereport(ERROR) from
+ *     the hook still takes the normal abort path -- this is relied upon;
+ *   - transaction state is still TRANS_INPROGRESS, so SPI is usable;
+ *   - not called for parallel workers.
+ */
+typedef void (*pre_record_commit_hook_type) (void);
+extern PGDLLIMPORT pre_record_commit_hook_type pre_record_commit_hook;
+
 typedef enum
 {
 	SUBXACT_EVENT_START_SUB,
--- a/src/backend/access/transam/xact.c
+++ b/src/backend/access/transam/xact.c
@@ -262,6 +262,13 @@
 static bool currentCommandIdUsed;
 
 /*
+ * Extension-installable hook fired inside CommitTransaction(), after every
+ * XACT_EVENT_PRE_COMMIT callback has run and before RecordTransactionCommit().
+ * See the contract in xact.h.
+ */
+pre_record_commit_hook_type pre_record_commit_hook = NULL;
+
+/*
  * xactStartTimestamp is the value of transaction_timestamp().
  * stmtStartTimestamp is the value of statement_timestamp().
  * xactStopTimestamp is the time at which we log a commit / abort WAL record,
@@ -2214,6 +2221,15 @@
 	CallXactCallbacks(is_parallel_worker ? XACT_EVENT_PARALLEL_PRE_COMMIT
 					  : XACT_EVENT_PRE_COMMIT);
 
+	/*
+	 * Last chance to abort: every PRE_COMMIT callback has run (so any
+	 * extension-managed remote transactions are already prepared), and our own
+	 * commit record has not been written yet.  An ERROR raised from here still
+	 * takes the normal abort path.
+	 */
+	if (!is_parallel_worker && pre_record_commit_hook != NULL)
+		(*pre_record_commit_hook) ();
+
 	/* If we might have parallel workers, clean them up now. */
 	if (IsInParallelMode())
 		AtEOXact_Parallel(true);
